# Branch naming

Follow the **Branch naming** section in `AGENTS.md` (repo root). That file is the repo-wide rule for every coding agent (Cursor, Claude, Codex, and others)—not a Cursor-only convention.

Summary: `<firstname>-<last-initial>/<dash-delimited-short-name>` (lowercase). Ask if the author name is unknown.
